# Internet reading for 09/2026

Very late for this one, but I've got a lot of links.

- [The Dc Command](https://www.chrisdeluca.me/2026/08/28/the-dc-command.html)

- [The open encrypted chat protocol](oxetene.net/the-open-encrypted-chat-proto
  col/) --- Doesn't look super secure or reliable from a protocol standpoint
  but it's a very simple idea from a very nice blog.

- [Do your worst](https://robertbirming.com/do-your-worst/)

- [The Internet Is Kind of a Predatory Cesspit Now](https://www.stephendiehl.
  com/posts/internet_predatory_cesspit/)

