- [Adversarial Fashion Confronts Surveillance Norms](https://spectrum.ieee.
  org/adversarial-fashion) --- It also confronts style norms. I like to follow
  this space and until these things are more "wearable" in a style context...
  nobody is going to wear them. This article showcases some of the most
  "accessible" designs I've seen so far though, so props to them.

